From: Kenneth Kasilag <kenneth@kasilag.me>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: implement L3 hardware flow tables

Add the register and table layouts of the PPE L3 flow engine, taken from
the SSDK: the router MAC table, the ingress and egress L3 interface tables,
the public NAT address table, the next hop table, the flow and host tables
with their independent operation registers, the per-flow hit counters, and
the flow control registers holding the lookup enable and the hardware flow
aging timer.

Add the low level accessors of the PPE L3 flow engine, in preparation for
offloading netfilter flowtables.
Program default physical-port frame limits before registering the netdev,
including when userspace leaves the default IP MTU unchanged.

Merged from:
  0506-01-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-add-l3-flow-engine-registers.patch
  0506-02-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-add-l3-flow-engine.patch

Based on work by:
  Kenneth Kasilag <kenneth@kasilag.me>

Signed-off-by: Kenneth Kasilag <kenneth@kasilag.me>
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

